window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Former elite Federation soldier, now turned space pirate, Jackson Burke has done his best to turn his life around - for the better. He isn't prepared when fate leaves a woman's safety totally in his hands. Since heroes don't leave a damsel in distress - and despite being outlaw pirates - the crew considers themselves the good guys, so Jackson assumes responsibility for the beauty. </p> <p>It’s hard enough that his ship is held together by rust and sheer will, now he's got to keep this good-guy thing straight and not give in to the urges the sassy female brings out in him. Raisa is everything a man could want, and for some reason, she seems to like him, rough edges and all, but he's on the Federation's wanted list, and they aren't known to back down.</p>"; 
